  "statement_html": "<div class=\"wims_instruction\"><img style=\"float:left;width:20px;height:20px;\" src=\"/api/static/gifs/calculator_not.svg\" alt=\"Calculatrices interdites\" >\t<strong>La calculatrice n'est pas autorisée.</strong></div>\t<div class=\"wims_question\">\t  On considère la relation \\(\\mathcal{C} = (1 + t)^2\\). On cherche à isoler la variable <span class=\"nowrap\">\\(t\\).</span> On a&nbsp;&#58;\t  <div class=\"wimscenter wims_scrollable\">\t  <table class=\"wimsborder\"><tr><th>\t  A. </th><th>B. </th><th> C.</th><th> D.\t  </th></tr>\t  <tr><td>\\(t = \\sqrt{1-\\mathcal{C} } \\) </td><td>\\(t = 1-\\sqrt{\\mathcal{C}} \\) </td><td>\\(t = \\sqrt{\\mathcal{C} - 1} \\) </td><td>\\(t = \\sqrt{\\mathcal{C}} - 1 \\) </td></tr>\t  </table>\t  </div>\t  <div class=\"wimscenter\">\t  <b>   </b>\t  </div>\t</div>",
